      },
      "narration": "Alright, this lesson's for you if you've ever pulled a GROUP BY query, walked into a meeting feeling confident, and then someone says, \"that's not what the dashboard shows.\" Instant credibility hit. By the end of this lesson, you'll be able to diagnose the five most common reasons your S-Q-L total drifts from the dashboard number, and you'll know exactly how to fix each one. We're talking duplicate rows from joins, missing filters, NULL handling, time zone boundaries, and metric definition drift. Let's get into it.",
