    {
      "id": "e15",
      "time_offset_ms": 245633,
      "type": "show_result",
      "target": "sql_viewer",
      "params": {},
      "narration": "Two rows jump out. Order 1012 in the West region, gross revenue 99,999.00, and look at that is test order column, it's flagged as 1. That's a test order someone forgot to clean up. Then order 1013 in the Northeast, 54,350.00, with a status of refunded. The dashboard silently excludes both of these. Your S-Q-L didn't. That's a gap of over 154,000 dollars right there.",
      "transition": "continuation",
