    {
      "id": "e18",
      "time_offset_ms": 295116,
      "type": "show_result",
      "target": "sql_viewer",
      "params": {},
      "narration": "Much better. Midwest holds steady at 120,925.00, it had no test or refunded orders. Northeast dropped from 199,825.00 down to 145,475.00 because we kicked out that refunded order. Southeast stays at 154,200.00. And the West fell hard, from 290,110.25 to 190,111.25, thanks to removing that 99,999 dollar test order. Grand total is now 610,711.25. We've already closed a huge chunk of the gap just by matching the dashboard's filters. Two causes down, three to go. The next one's invisible unless you know to look for it.",
      "transition": "continuation",
      "clears": [],
      "phases": []
    },
    {
