      "time_offset_ms": 318199,
      "type": "highlight_section",
      "target": "sql_viewer",
      "params": {
        "section": "scene3a_sum_with_nulls"
      },
      "narration": "Cause number three: NULLs silently excluded from aggregation. This is one of those S-Q-L standard behaviors that trips people up forever. SUM, AVG, and COUNT of a column all skip NULL values entirely. If your dashboard treats NULLs as zero, or vice versa, your totals diverge. Let's look at the discount amount column.",
      "transition": "new_concept",
