    {
      "id": "e24",
      "time_offset_ms": 369083,
      "type": "show_result",
      "target": "sql_viewer",
      "params": {},
      "narration": "There they are. Order 1003 in the Southeast, gross revenue 18,990.00, discount amount is NULL. And order 1011, also Southeast, 46,890.00, also NULL. These aren't zero-discount orders, they're orders where the discount was never recorded. Big difference. If the dashboard treats those as zero and your S-Q-L skips them entirely, you'll get different totals.",
