      "narration": "Cause number four: time zone boundaries. This one only shows up at the edges of your date range, which makes it maddeningly hard to spot. If your database stores timestamps in UTC but the dashboard renders in US Eastern, orders near midnight shift across date boundaries. Let's look at the evidence.",
